--- !u!114 &9212458045026321396
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2746995387554433470}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2b78bae8488b3994180519d2789ee0e7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  menualStrings:
  - '1. Key Setting


    W A S D - Moving

    I - Inventory

    T - Move information

    F
    - Picking up

    R - Laying (In tent)

    Q - Info

    E - Cooking / Talk
    to NPC

    Right click - Eating

    Left click - Move item

    The mouse cursor
    is activated with the inventory open.

    ESC - Menu'
  - 'Extra Information

    

    - If you visit a building with a red roof, you
    can buy things.

    - Tents can only be set up at the campsite.

    - If
    you get injured, you can treat it with a medical kit.

    - Performing a quest
    gives you a good reward.

    - If you don''t have hunger, you lose your stamina
    quickly, and if you don''t, you die.

    - Cooking is annoying, but it''s better
    to cook often.

    - Finally, what''s at the end of this road?'
  popup: {fileID: 56211600007767273}
  menualText: {fileID: 7043906285515395319}
  pageText: {fileID: 2640523755349044676}
